      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Structural pattern</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Tier 2</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Composite</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build trees where a single item and a whole group answer the same questions: a file and a folder both have a size, a dish and a combo both have a price, a number and an expression both have a value. Learn the leaf / container split, the safety vs transparency trade-off for <code>add()</code>, how to stop cycles, and why the Linux dentry tree is the same idea.</p>\n"
  },
